## Toolsets{% #toolsets %}
The Datadog MCP Server supports *toolsets*, which allow you to use only the [MCP tools](https://docs.datadoghq.com/mcp_server/tools.md) you need, saving valuable context window space. To use a toolset, include the `toolsets` query parameter in the endpoint URL when connecting to the MCP Server (remote authentication only).

